-- test: in a package with a `serve` section, `L_srv` of the preview is the top label (`spec/31 §7` rule 6), and it joins every reading of `Clock.now` (ADR 0116 amendment of 2026-11-09, C1 item 3): `handle` cannot put the time in its `internal` reply (U4001)
-- spec: spec/14 §3
-- expect: error U4001 at src/srv.una:12:41
module srv

import std.host (Reply, Request)

pub handle(request: internal Request) -> internal Reply
  uses @clock: Clock[now]
=
  let now = @clock.now()
  Reply(status: 200, headers: [], body: "{now}")
